hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23863","Yahya ibn Sa'id narrated to me, Sufyan narrated to us, and Abdurrahman ibn Mahdi informed us, Sufyan and Za'idah informed us, from Mansur from Mujahid from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam, Abdurrahman said in his hadith: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate and perform ablution and sprinkle his private part with water, and Yahya said in his hadith: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinated and sprinkled his private part."
